{
  "description": "M18 payroll: the October 2026 Salary Calculation rows of the workbook (real day counts, fake rupee amounts) plus edge cases. Expected values follow E = D/E3, F = E*(C+extra), H = F-G, I = MIN(F,D), J = I-G (rounded half away from zero).",
  "header": {
